cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the FLEAT paper listed under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "FLEAT experimental runner"
abstract: >-
  Simulation-first federated learning benchmark runner implementing FLEAT:
  per-client adaptive local-step control, masked uploads with
  contributor-aware aggregation, and energy/time accounting over
  heterogeneous edge devices, with FedAvg, FedProx, local-update-only and
  pruning-only baselines.
